{"file":"Cypress-1.3.0-v2.zip","bytes":72998,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"cypress","displayName":"Cypress","description":"Create, update, and fix Cypress tests. Connect to Cypress Cloud to see test results and use data to manage your test suite.","version":"1.3.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/cypress-io/ai-toolkit","keywords":["plugin","cypress","ai","testing","automation","qa"]},{"path":".cursor-plugin/plugin.json","name":"cypress","displayName":"Cypress","description":"Create, update, and fix Cypress tests. Connect to Cypress Cloud to see test results and use data to manage your test suite.","version":"1.3.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/cypress-io/ai-toolkit","keywords":["plugin","cypress","ai","testing","automation","qa"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/cypress-author/SKILL.md","name":"cypress-author","description":"Creates, updates, and fixes Cypress tests (E2E/end-to-end and component tests). Use when the user asks to create tests, add tests, write tests, update tests, test this file/component, new spec, or fix a failing or flaky test. Apply even when the user does not say 'Cypress' (e.g. 'create tests for this file'). Prefer cypress-explain when the user only wants to explain or review tests without changing code.","headings":["Cypress Author","Task","Mandatory flow (do not skip)","Conclusion"],"name_hint":"cypress · author","description_zh":"创建、更新和修复Cypress端到端或组件测试，处理新增规格、失败和不稳定测试；仅解释或审查时使用cypress-explain。"},{"path":"skills/cypress-cloud-cli/SKILL.md","name":"cypress-cloud-cli","description":"Runs the cy-cloud CLI to inspect Cypress Cloud organizations, projects, runs, specs, tests, failure screenshots, and Test Replay data. Use when the user mentions Cypress Cloud, cy-cloud, cypress-cloud-cli, a Cloud run or test URL, failing or flaky Cypress tests, Test Replay, run triage, Cloud artifacts, or asks why a recorded test failed.","headings":["Cypress Cloud CLI","Start safely","Discover instead of guessing","Identifiers and pagination","Route by task","Cache and common recovery"],"name_hint":"cypress · cloud · cli","description_zh":"使用cy-cloud CLI查看Cypress Cloud组织、项目、运行、测试、失败截图及Test Replay，分析已记录测试失败与不稳定运行。"},{"path":"skills/cypress-docs/SKILL.md","name":"cypress-docs","description":"Search and extract Cypress information from official documentation (docs.cypress.io, cypress.io); prefer LLM markdown under /llm/* and refuse unverified API or behavior claims.","headings":["Cypress Documentation","Purpose","When to use","Source Prioritization","Primary Sources (ALWAYS search first)","🤖 LLM-Optimized Docs Strategy","Critical Rules","Never Assume Missing Features","Anti-Hallucination Guard","Search Strategy","1. Classify the Query","2. Search Flow","3. Error-Aware Routing","Structured Extraction Rules","Commands","Concepts","Configuration","Version Awareness"],"name_hint":"cypress · 文档","description_zh":"从Cypress官方文档搜索和提取信息，优先使用LLM Markdown，不给出未经核验的API或行为结论。"},{"path":"skills/cypress-explain/SKILL.md","name":"cypress-explain","description":"Explains Cypress tests (E2E and component tests), and answers questions about Cypress use and behavior. Use when the user asks to explain how a test works, explain how Cypress works, review or critique a test without writing code. Apply even when the user does not say 'Cypress' (e.g. 'explain this test'). Prefer the cypress-author skill when the user wants to create, fix, or update tests.","headings":["Cypress Explain","Inputs","Mandatory flow (do not skip)"],"name_hint":"cypress · explain","description_zh":"解释Cypress端到端和组件测试的工作方式，回答使用与行为问题，支持不修改代码的测试审查；编写或修复交给cypress-author。"},{"path":"skills/cypress-tap/SKILL.md","name":"cypress-tap","description":"Drives a running Cypress open-mode session through `cypress tap` to run and rerun specs, wait for fresh results, inspect reporter and command logs, and query or rewind the app under test through DOM, accessibility, styles, and snapshots. Use when authoring or debugging Cypress e2e or component specs, discovering selectors, diagnosing failures, or verifying test behavior without GUI interaction. Not for one-shot headless runs. Requires Cypress 15.21+, a Chromium-family browser, and a running `cypress open` session.","headings":["Driving Cypress with `cypress tap`","Prerequisites","Route by task","Core commands","The non-negotiable verdict rule","Critical correctness rules","Output contract","Performance defaults"],"name_hint":"cypress · tap","description_zh":"通过cypress tap操作已运行的Cypress开放模式会话，运行或重跑规格、等待新结果、读取日志、查DOM和回退快照，帮助定位选择器与调试；需15.21以上版本及Chromium，不用于一次性无界面运行。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["✨ Cypress AI Toolkit","The problem this solves","What's in the toolkit","Model Context Protocol (MCP)","Skills","What's coming","Getting started","Plugin","Manual Installation","Who this is for","Contributing","Releases","PR Checks","Post-PR Actions","License"]},{"path":"mcp/README.md","headings":["Model Context Protocol Definitions"]},{"path":"skills/README.md","headings":["Skills","Installation","Install via plugin (recommended)","Install via skills","Install via GitHub CLI","Manually","Available skills","[`cypress-author`](./cypress-author)","[`cypress-explain`](./cypress-explain)","[`cypress-docs`](./cypress-docs)","[`cypress-tap`](./cypress-tap)","[`cypress-cloud-cli`](./cypress-cloud-cli)","Troubleshooting","How do I know the skill is triggering?","The skill isn't triggering","The skill is using too many tokens","The output isn't what I want*","Results are slow","Contributing"]},{"path":"prompt-library/cypress-v16-migration/README.md","headings":["Cypress v16 Migration Prompts","Who this is for","What changed in v16","How to use these prompts","Prompt Library","Have feedback on a prompt?"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor-plugin/marketplace.json",".cursor-plugin/plugin.json",".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/general.md",".github/pul